  "footnotes": [],
  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 22 as printed (總數 4 rows, then 臺北, 新竹, 臺中, 臺南, 高雄 2 rows each, 臺東 and 花蓮港 4 rows each); each pair is 義務出役 / 有償勞力; the table runs over the left (p. 462) and right (p. 463) pages.",
   "Row labels combine the 州廳 (letter-spaced in print, written without spaces), the 理蕃所管外/管內 bracket label (〃 = ditto as printed, meaning 理蕃所管內) and 義務出役 / 有償勞力. 臺北 prints 理蕃所管內 only.",
   "The headings 勞働 (over 物資運搬 and 開墾 …) and 延人員 span the columns and are not repeated in the column names; the column printed 物資運搬 has a leading dot in the heading (・物資運搬); 開墾 is split across the gutter (開 on p. 462, 墾 on p. 463).",
   "The 勞銀總額 and 平均一日一人ノ勞銀 columns print a figure only on the 有償勞力 line of each pair; the 義務出役 line shows … (unit 圓 printed above the first figure).",
   "Check: every row 總數 = 男 + 女, 男 = sum of the five 男 columns, 女 = sum of the five 女 columns — reconciles in all 22 rows.",
   "Check: the 理蕃所管外 and 理蕃所管內 rows of 總數 equal the sums of the corresponding 州廳 rows in every figure column up to 其ノ他 女 (勞銀總額 not checked) — reconciles.",
   "Row 總數 管外 義務出役 and 臺東 管外 義務出役 both print 林業 424 / 40 (and 有償 395 in 林業 女 twice); transcribed as printed."
